        "Open procedure"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Sourcing strategy",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation sets out the rules which apply to open procedure procurements, a type of procedure that permits any interested supplier to submit a tender in response to a call for competition. The regulation also sets out the rules regarding the minimum time limit that a contracting authority may set for the receipt of tenders under this procedure, which vary depending on the circumstances.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Consideration is given as to whether the single stage open procedure is an appropriate procurement approach; by reference to the nature of the contract, its complexity and anticipated number of bidders.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "adopt the open procedure only where the contracting authority is prepared to accept and evaluate a tender from each interested supplier, given that there is no ability to incorporate a standalone selection stage in order to reduce the number of interested suppliers before inviting the submission of tenders",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure the time limit for receipt of tenders complies with the minimum periods set out in this regulation (i.e. regulation 27), including any time period shortened as a result of the publication of a prior information notice (PIN) or a state of urgency.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 20: Competitive tendering procedures",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 54: Time limits",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Open procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
